      "note": "The complete route/width/theme/region matrix is captured. Words accompany every status mark; links remain native, each offer has one primary email action, and there is no editable user state or destructive path. Ordinary 320/390/1440 reflow and the prior 200% computed-text failure were checked. Actual browser zoom and hardware limitations are stated in the notes, not passed by simulation.",
