      "note": "M1 dates are beside each status on both lists in both languages; D21 records the four truthful lifecycle states. M2 language switches retain place; M3 published claims trace to local content/owner decisions. D14/D19 govern the current short-index navigation; D22 governs capacity and defers a reply-time promise. The inherited S-1 visual-proof shortfall remains F6, a major design-quality finding at the same severity as the previous review.",
